; grammatical tense values — kaala IS tense; these are its forms in language
; "vartamana kaalam", "bhoota kaalam", "bhavisyat kaalam" (Malayalam grammar)

(sangati kaala
  (swarupa brahma)
  (kriya spanda)
  (yukta karma kshetrajna)
  (sthita om kshetra)
  (poorva prakaasha)
  (janaka thaalam vartamana-kaala bhuta-kaala bhavishya-kaala vidhi-kaala sambhavana-kaala))
